# Technical debt register — {{PROJECT_NAME}}

A lightweight register of meaningful gaps — things with a real, explainable impact and priority. Not a
dumping ground for cosmetic nitpicks. An entry is not an instruction to fix it immediately: existing code is
revisited when touched by new work, a defect, a security issue, a material architecture problem, or an
explicit request. LOW review findings the team chooses not to fix now may be recorded here.

